{"seq":9,"slug":"ai-product-discovery-validation","title":"AI 产品发现与验证","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation","rating":{"composite":4.33,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# AI 产品发现与验证 简介\n\nAI 原型很容易制造“看起来已经成立”的错觉：模型能完成一次精彩演示，不等于目标用户反复遇到这个问题，更不等于他们愿意改变现有流程、承担不确定性并持续付费。本 hub 面向正在寻找 AI 产品方向的独立开发者、产品工程师与小团队负责人，提供一套从问题证据走到交付承诺的发现系统，让团队用可证伪的假设、逐级增强的实验和预先写好的决策阈值控制投入。\n\n## 分工边界\n\n本 hub 聚焦“是否值得做、AI 是否适合做、证据是否足以进入交付”的前置决策，不展开上线后的渠道运营、留存分析或计费实现。\n\n它与[独立产品定位与差异化](../01_indie-product-positioning/_INTRODUCTION.md)的分工是：定位 hub 帮你选择市场切口与表达差异，本 hub 把那个方向拆成可验证的用户、需求、能力与商业假设。它与[独立产品的数据分析](../08_indie-product-analytics/_INTRODUCTION.md)的分工是：数据分析 hub 处理产品上线后的测量体系，本 hub 处理交付前的小样本质性证据、承诺行为和可行性评测。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n读者应能描述一个候选产品想服务的场景，并具备制作简单落地页、交互原型或调用模型 API 的能力。\n\n不要求先掌握统计推断或机器学习训练；文中会给出适合小样本决策的证据纪律，并把模型质量问题转成可执行的任务级评测。\n\n## 章节概览\n\n第一章**问题与目标用户**建立问题、理想客户画像和待办任务的统一表述，排序风险假设，并设计少诱导的访谈与情境观察。\n\n第二章**需求证据实验**区分口头兴趣与真实承诺，用假门、预售、礼宾服务和绿野仙踪实验逐步提高证据强度。\n\n第三章**AI 可行性与评测**同时检验能力、质量、延迟、成本、信任与风险，并用真实任务样本驱动原型迭代。\n\n第四章**决策与交付衔接**把付费意愿、证据账本和停止条件合并为明确门槛，再把已验证边界交给交付团队。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n第一次做产品的读者应按四章顺序学习，并把同一个候选问题贯穿所有练习，避免每种方法验证不同方向。\n\n已有用户但准备加入 AI 功能的团队，可以先读第三章校准能力与信任，再回到第一章确认用户究竟需要自动化、增强还是保持人工控制。\n\n已经完成访谈却仍无法决策的团队，可直接从第二章的证据阶梯和第四章的阈值账本开始，把“大家似乎喜欢”改写成能推进、调整或停止的条件。\n\n完成本 hub 后，你应得到的不是一份华丽演示，而是一份可审计的决策包：明确的用户与任务、被证据更新的假设、任务级评测结果、真实的付费或承诺信号，以及进入交付仍需监控的风险。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-and-customer","title":"问题与目标用户","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/problem-and-customer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-icp-and-job","title":"用问题、ICP 与待办任务锁定发现对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/problem-and-customer/problem-icp-and-job"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risky-assumption-map","title":"用风险假设地图决定先验证什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/problem-and-customer/risky-assumption-map"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interview-and-observation","title":"用访谈与情境观察取得行为证据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/problem-and-customer/interview-and-observation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-experiments","title":"需求证据实验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/demand-experiments","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evidence-ladder-and-demand-signals","title":"用证据阶梯区分兴趣与真实需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/demand-experiments/evidence-ladder-and-demand-signals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fake-door-and-commitment-tests","title":"用假门与承诺测试验证行动动力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/demand-experiments/fake-door-and-commitment-tests"},{"seq":3,"slug":"concierge-and-wizard-of-oz","title":"用礼宾与绿野仙踪实验验证端到端价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/demand-experiments/concierge-and-wizard-of-oz"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-feasibility-and-evals","title":"AI 可行性与评测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capability-quality-and-task-boundary","title":"用任务边界定义 AI 能力与质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals/capability-quality-and-task-boundary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-cost-trust-and-risk","title":"联合验证延迟、成本、信任与风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals/latency-cost-trust-and-risk"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eval-driven-prototypes","title":"用评测驱动原型替代演示驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals/eval-driven-prototypes"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"decisions-and-handoff","title":"决策与交付衔接","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/decisions-and-handoff","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"willingness-to-pay-and-pricing-signals","title":"用付费意愿与定价信号检验商业价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/decisions-and-handoff/willingness-to-pay-and-pricing-signals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thresholds-and-evidence-ledger","title":"用决策阈值与证据账本对抗确认偏误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/decisions-and-handoff/thresholds-and-evidence-ledger"},{"seq":3,"slug":"discovery-to-delivery-handoff","title":"把发现证据转成可执行的交付契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/decisions-and-handoff/discovery-to-delivery-handoff"}]}]}